      "en": "For we have much joy and comfort in your love, because the hearts of the saints have been refreshed through you, brother.",
      "ko": "형제여 성도들의 마음이 너로 말미암아 평안함을 얻었으니 내가 너의 사랑으로 많은 기쁨과 위로를 얻었노라",
      "source_text_hash": "3114e5d409e122b6ed86642ffa074aa84073a36deb342f53e519deaf66a39400",
      "translation_text_hash": "f6ca90cb5ed807069e3127c10e3d025dc573d336a1ae0be5820da3fc8d00c4f7",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
